{'symbol': 'XRAY', 'date': '2022-03-18 08:00:00', 'title': 'DENTSPLY SIRONA TO PARTICIPATE IN THE PIPER SANDLER VIRTUAL DENTAL DAY', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., MARCH 18, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DENTSPLY SIRONA INC. (“DENTSPLY SIRONA”) (NASDAQ: XRAY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE PIPER SANDLER VIRTUAL DENTAL DAY. DON CASEY, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, IS SCHEDULED TO PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT DISCUSSION ON TUESDAY, MARCH 29, 2022 AT 1:00 PM ET.'}